            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Chef Benji"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe &amp; as easy as it gets! However, keep in mind that the BBQ sauce is the most significant ingredient as far as taste goes. If you are serving a crowd, a thick &amp; sweet sauce is probably your best bet. Sweet Baby Rays is a safe &amp; inexpensive option that most people enjoy but there are tons of great sauces! If you have out of town guest, you can buy a local mom &amp; pop BBQ sauce and serve these meatballs as an easy and unique appetizer that showcases some of the local flavors.",
            "datePublished": "2020-12-24T23:53:21.483Z"
          },
